{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-mat-22-1","title":"Matthew 22:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The parable of the marriage of the king's son. 9 The vocation of the Gentiles. 12 The punishment of him that wanted the wedding garment. 15 Tribute ought to be paid to Caesar. 23 Christ confutes the Sadducees for the resurrection; 34 answers the lawyer, which is the first and great commandment; 41 and puzzles the Pharisees by a question about the Messias.</p>\n<p>9:15-17; 12:43-45; 13:3-11; 20:1-16; 21:28-46; Mr 4:33,34; Lu 8:10 Lu 14:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-22-2","title":"Matthew 22:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>kingdom. 13:24,31-33,44-47; 25:1,14 which. 25:1-13; Ps 45:10-16; Joh 3:29,30; 2Co 11:2; Eph 5:24-32; Re 19:7-9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-22-3","title":"Matthew 22:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>sent. 3:2; 10:6,7; Ps 68:11; Pr 9:1-3; Isa 55:1,2; Jer 25:4; 35:15 Mr 6:7-11; Lu 9:1-6; 14:15-17; Re 22:17 that. 1Sa 9:13; Zep 1:7 and they would not. 23:37; Ps 81:10-12; Pr 1:24-32; Isa 30:15; Jer 6:16,17; Ho 11:2,7 Lu 13:34; 15:28; 19:27; Joh 5:40; Ac 13:45; Ro 10:21; Heb 12:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-22-4","title":"Matthew 22:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>other. Lu 10:1-16; 24:46,47; Ac 1:8; 11:19,20; 13:46; 28:17-31 Behold. Pr 9:1,2; So 5:1; Joh 6:50-57; Ro 8:32; 1Co 5:7,8 and all. 8; Ne 9:17; Ps 86:5; Lu 14:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-22-5","title":"Matthew 22:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>they. Ge 19:14; 25:34; Ps 106:24,25; Pr 1:7,24,25; Ac 2:13; 24:25; R