siah our righteousness, as it is written, The Lord said to my Lord,\" etc.</p>\n<p>Ps 110:1; Ac 2:34,35; 1Co 15:25; Heb 1:3,13; 10:12,13; 12:2 my Lord. Joh 20:28; 1Co 1:2; Php 3:8 till. Ge 3:15; Ps 2:8,9; 21:9; Isa 63:1-6; Lu 19:27; Re 19:19-21 Re 20:1-3,11-15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-22-45","title":"Matthew 22:45","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":45,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":45},"content":"<p>how. Joh 8:58; Ro 1:3,4; 9:5; Php 2:6-8; 1Ti 3:16; Heb 2:14; Re 22:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-mat-22-46","title":"Matthew 22:46","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"MAT","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":46,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":46},"content":"<p>no. 21:27; Job 32:15,16; Isa 50:2-9; Lu 13:17; 14:6; Joh 8:7-9; Ac 4:14 neither. Mr 12:34; Lu 20:40</p>"}]}